<title>HONG KONG: Sun Fook Kong interim loss at HK$11.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Sun Fook Kong interim loss at HK$11.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.4 loss   vs 10.3 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.64 gain  vs 90.00 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    11.82 loss vs 86.15 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     682.79     vs 772.35</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sun Fook Kong Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Sun Fook Kong Holdings is a construction and civil engineering company. Exceptional gain represents surplus on sale of long term investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
